textforge-c provides CMake targets:

  find_package(textforge-c CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE textforge-c::textforge-c)

textforge-c provides pkg-config modules:

  # C bindings for the TextForge text-processing DSL
  textforge-c

Building this port requires cargo from a stable Rust toolchain (https://rustup.rs)
on the build machine, plus the Rust standard library for the target when cross
building (rustup target add <triple>). No network access is needed: the source
archive contains every Rust dependency.
